      "hash": "7b5f30ecc4e4e575",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I should be grateful for my long life.\\c\\nNever did I think I would get to see the bones of\\na dragon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_02_01",
      "hash": "e7c8eb752043ec2a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "We have two Fossils of rare, prehistoric Pokémon\\non exhibit."
